# Checkouts the review/fix workflows reuse instead of cloning.
# One line per repository, absolute host path, no quotes:
#
#   owner/repo=/home/vsilvestre/projects/oss/checkout
#
# The workflow fetches the pull request branch into that checkout and adds a
# detached worktree under WORK_ROOT. Your branch, your index and your working
# tree are never touched.
#
# For opencode=local the configured path must also exist at the same absolute
# path inside the container, exactly like STATE_DIR.

# awf-project/cli=/home/vsilvestre/projects/oss/cli
# awf-project/tower=/home/vsilvestre/projects/oss/tower
